        "geology": "Mainly Carbonates rocks (limestones and dolostone) from Triasic to upper cretaceous periods. Conglomerate and alluvial deposits in polje and valleys (Oligocene and Quaternary). Karst landscape and features, deep karstification below the sea-level.",
